					"documentation": "# Create Sale Flow of events\n\n## Basic Flow\n\n1. *Register* inserts the **email** and **password**.\n2. *System* login egiten du.\n\n## Alternative flow (Sale is not created)\n1. Some fields are empty. System informs the *Register*.\n2. **email** ez da existitzen. System informs the *Register*.\n3. **password** okerra da. System informs the *Register*.\n4. *System* ez du Login egiten\n",
					"attributes": [
